    "chapter": "交班与通知写作",
    "subtype": "full_essay",
    "stem": "车间打算改用电子清单交班。写一篇英文短文，对比纸质与电子清单的优缺点，并提出你建议的交班做法。",
    "requirements": [
      "分别写出纸质清单和电子清单的一项优点与一项缺点。",
      "说明你推荐哪一种作为日常交班工具，并给出理由。",
      "说明设备无法使用时如何备份记录。"
    ],
    "keywords": ["paper checklist", "digital checklist", "handover", "backup"],
    "min_words": 110,
    "max_words": 160,
    "sample_response": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "A clear handover helps the next shift start work without guessing. Both paper and digital checklists can help, but they have different strengths.",
        "tts": { "voice": "stella" }
      },
      { "type": "text", "text": "\n\n" },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "A paper checklist is easy to use when the network is down. However, a page can get lost, and handwriting may be hard to read. A digital checklist lets both shifts see the latest notes in one place. It is also easier to find old records. The main problem is that a tablet may run out of power.",
        "tts": { "voice": "stella" }
      },
      { "type": "text", "text": "\n\n" },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "I would use the digital checklist every day and keep printed copies as a backup. If the tablet stops working, workers can write the date, time, and any unfinished tasks on paper. The shift lead can add those notes to the digital record later.",
        "tts": { "voice": "stella" }
      }
    ],
    "rubric": { "task_completion": 45, "language_accuracy": 30, "coherence": 25 },
    "analysis": [
      { "type": "text", "text": "第一段说明交班记录的目的，第二段用 " },
      { "type": "text", "text": "However", "tts": { "voice": "stella" } },
      { "type": "text", "text": " 转入缺点并比较两种清单，最后一段给出日常做法和设备故障时的备份流程。" }
    ]
  },
